        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/ps5-physical.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>You may scoff at how little real-world change petitions typically produce, but you can't deny that this particular campaign has a lot of user support behind it. <a href=\"https://www.change.org/p/don-t-kill-the-disc-tell-sony-to-keep-physical-playstation-games\">The Don't Kill the Disc Change.org petition</a>, which was launched in the wake of <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/sony-ending-playstation-discs-physical-media-january-2028\">Sony's bombshell decision to end physical disc manufacturing in January 2028</a>, has amassed over 170,000 signatures at the time of writing.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/petition-against-sony-killing-playstation-physical-media\">Read more</a></p>",
